</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Machine Stats for HMI, Andon]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[EQU(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State) MOV(1,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,[EQU(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) ] MOV(2,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,EQU(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State) MOV(4,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,[EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream_Rev,STXXXX.State) ] MOV(5,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,[EQU(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) ] MOV(6,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode) MOV(28,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStopped,STXXXX.Mode) MOV(29,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,NEQ(0,STXXXX.Error) MOV(30,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,XIO(Safety_PowerOn_Placeholder.DN) MOV(31,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_MachineState) ,MOV(STXXXX.Warning,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_Warning) MOV(STXXXX.Error,FiSZ_BI_XXXX_MachineStats.PLC_Fault) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="_XXXX_Outputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Straight Track Standard Code v2.0 
-------------------------------------------------------
Station XXXX Outputs
-------------------------------------------------------
This routine contains logic to control the outputs of Station XXXX.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output:
Run conveyor
Output Triggers:
1. Infeeding state
2. Outfeeding state
3. Manual mode
Output Permissives:
1. Stop photoeye is clear
2. Downstream station conevyor is running
3. HMI coneyor jog forward or reverse pushbutton]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Safety_PowerOn_Placeholder.DN)[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode) [EQU(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State) XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE) ,EQU(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) XIO(STXXXX_PE_RE) XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Dir) ,EQU(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State) XIC(STZZZZ_Conv_Run) XIC(Outfeed_InPosition_Placeholder) ,EQU(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) XIC(STYYYY_Conv_Run) XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Dir) XIC(Outfeed_InPosition_Placeholder) ] ,EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode) [XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Fwd_HMI) ,XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Rev_HMI) XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Dir) ] ]OTE(STXXXX_Conv_Run);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output:
Conveyor Direction
Output Triggers:
1. Manual mode
Output Permissives:
1. HMI coneyor jog reverse pushbutton]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Safety_PowerOn_Placeholder.DN)[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode) [EQU(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) ] ,EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode) XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Rev_HMI) ]OTE(STXXXX_Conv_Dir);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output:
Release Push Button Light
Output Triggers:
1. Blink when waiting for operator press
2. Solid when waiting to outfeed or when outfeeding]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[EQU(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State) XIC(MES_FFFFF_XXXX.Data.UpstreamOK) XIC(Sys_Slow_Blink) ,[EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State) ] ]OTE(STXXXX_Release_Lt);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="_XXXX_States" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Straight Track Standard Code v2.0 
-------------------------------------------------------
Station XXXX States
-------------------------------------------------------
This routine contains logic to control the state of station XXXX. The general function of this station is:
1. Infeed part from YYYY or ZZZZ
2. Operator works on part
3. Outfeed part to ZZZZ or YYYY
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Waiting to infeed part from upstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is clear
Next State:
Infeeding part from upstream station
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State)XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE)XIO(STXXXX_PE_RE)[EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STYYYY.State) MOV(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STZZZZ.State) MOV(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Infeeding part from upstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is blocked
2. Infeeding steady state timer is done
3a. Station is an active workstation
3b. Station is not an active workstation
Next State:
a. Operator working on part
b. Waiting to outfeed part to downstream station
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State)XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE)TON(STXXXX_Infeeding_TON,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Infeeding_TON.DN)[XIC(STXXXX_SW_Active) MOV(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State) ,XIO(STXXXX_SW_Active) MOV(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Operator working on part
Next State Conditions: 
1. Release steady state timer is done
2. MES is ok to release
3a. Station is an active workstation and the release pushbutton is pressed
3b. Station is not an active workstation
Next State:
Waiting to outfeed part to downstream station, 
send feedback to MES that part is releasing
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State)TON(STXXXX_Release_TON,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Release_TON.DN)XIC(MES_FFFFF_XXXX.Data.UpstreamOK)[OTE(MES_FFFFF_XXXX.OK) ,[XIC(STXXXX_SW_Active) XIC(STXXXX_PB_Release) ,XIO(STXXXX_SW_Active) ] MOV(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Waiting to outfeed part to downstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is blocked
2. Downstream station is in the infeeding state
Next State:
Outfeeding part to downstream station, 
send feedback to MES that part is released]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State)XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE)EQU(State_Infeeding,STZZZZ.State)[MOV(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State) ,OTL(MES_FFFFF_XXXX.DN) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Outfeeding part to downstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is clear
2. Outfeeding steady state timer is done
Next State:
Waiting to infeed part from upstream station]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State)XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE)XIC(Outfeed_Complete_Placeholder)TON(STXXXX_Outfeeding_TON,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Outfeeding_TON.DN)MOV(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[***

Reverse States

***]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Infeeding part from upstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is blocked
2. Infeeding steady state timer is done
Next State:
b. Waiting to outfeed part to downstream station
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State)XIC(STXXXX_PE_RE)TON(STXXXX_Infeeding_Rev_TON,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Infeeding_Rev_TON.DN)MOV(State_WaitingForDownstream_Rev,STXXXX.State);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Waiting to outfeed part to downstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is blocked
2. Downstream station is in the infeeding state
Next State:
Outfeeding part to downstream station]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream_Rev,STXXXX.State)[XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE) ,XIC(STXXXX_PE_RE) ]EQU(State_Infeeding,STYYYY.State)MOV(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State: 
Outfeeding part to downstream station
Next State Conditions: 
1. Stop photoeye is clear
2. Outfeeding steady state timer is done
Next State:
Waiting to infeed part from upstream station]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,STXXXX.State)XIO(STXXXX_PE_RE)XIC(Outfeed_Complete_Placeholder)TON(STXXXX_Outfeeding_Rev_TON,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Outfeeding_Rev_TON.DN)MOV(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="_XXXX_Status" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Straight Track Standard Code v2.0 
-------------------------------------------------------
Station XXXX Status
-------------------------------------------------------
Inputs and Configuration]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Configuration bits for straight track stations
Turn on if functionality exists
If configuration bit is not listed, it is marked as spare and available for use]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(STXXXX.Config.5)XIC(STXXXX.Config.6)XIC(STXXXX.Config.10)XIC(STXXXX.Config.11)XIC(STXXXX.Config.30)NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[HMI Destination/Route Interface]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode)XIC(STXXXX_Accept_Manual_Route_HMI)MOV(STXXXX_Manual_Route_HMI,STXXXX_Route);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Needed for standard HMI level 2 display parameter passing]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE) ,XIC(STXXXX_PE_RE) ]OTE(STXXXX_PE_SE);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[HMI state descriptions]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[MOV(99,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State) MOV(0,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State) MOV(1,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State) MOV(10,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,[EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ,EQU(State_WaitingForDownstream_Rev,STXXXX.State) ] MOV(2,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_Outfeeding,STXXXX.State) MOV(3,STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_InfeedingConveyorReverse,CTXXXX.State) MOV(51,CTXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,EQU(State_OutfeedingConveyorReverse,CTXXXX.State) MOV(55,CTXXXX_State_Desc_Idx) ,NEQ(State_Desc_HMI[STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx],STXXXX_State_Desc_HMI) MOV(State_Desc_HMI[STXXXX_State_Desc_Idx],STXXXX_State_Desc_HMI) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cycle stop logic
Cycle start logic (station must have no active errors)
Manual mode logic]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(STXXXX.Stop_HMI) MOV(Sys_Mode_CycleStopped,STXXXX.Mode) ,[XIC(STXXXX.Start_HMI) ,XIC(Group_Cycle_Start) NEQ(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode) ] EQU(STXXXX.Error,0) MOV(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode) ,XIC(STXXXX.Manual_HMI) MOV(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[ HMI set state to waiting to infeed part from upstream station
1. HMI force empty pushbutton
2. Stop photoeye is clear
 HMI set state to operator working on part
1. HMI force occupied pushbutton
2. Stop photoeye is blocked
3. Station is an active workstation
 HMI set state to waiting to outfeed part to downstream station
1. HMI force occupied pushbutton
2. Stop photoeye is blocked
3. Station is not an active workstation]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode)[XIC(STXXXX.SetState_PartClear_HMI) XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE) MOV(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State) ,XIC(STXXXX.SetState_PartPresent_HMI) XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE) [XIC(STXXXX_SW_Active) MOV(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State) ,XIO(STXXXX_SW_Active) MOV(State_WaitingForDownstream,STXXXX.State) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear station faults and warnings with the HMI fault reset pushbutton]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Sys_Alm_Reset_HMI)[CLR(STXXXX.Error) ,CLR(STXXXX.Warning) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If there is an active fault cycle stop the station]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NEQ(STXXXX.Error,0)EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)MOV(Sys_Mode_CycleStopped,STXXXX.Mode);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Station faults]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Safety_PowerOn_Placeholder.DN)OTL(STXXXX.Error.0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_WaitingForPart,STXXXX.State)XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE)TON(STXXXX_Part_Found_Flt,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Part_Found_Flt.DN)OTL(STXXXX.Error.1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)LIM(State_WaitingForOperator,STXXXX.State,State_WaitingForDownstream)XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE)TON(STXXXX_Part_Lost_Flt,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Part_Lost_Flt.DN)OTL(STXXXX.Error.2);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_CycleStarted,STXXXX.Mode)EQU(State_Infeeding,STXXXX.State)XIC(STXXXX_Conv_Run)TON(STXXXX_Part_Load_Flt,?,?)XIC(STXXXX_Part_Load_Flt.DN)OTL(STXXXX.Error.3);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(IOLMaster_Connection_Faulted_Placeholder)OTL(STXXXX.Error.5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(STXXXX.Start_HMI)NEQ(STXXXX.Error,0)OTL(STXXXX.Warning.0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode)XIC(STXXXX.SetState_PartClear_HMI)XIC(STXXXX_PE_FE)OTL(STXXXX.Warning.1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Sys_Mode_Manual,STXXXX.Mode)XIC(STXXXX.SetState_PartPresent_HMI)XIO(STXXXX_PE_FE)OTL(STXXXX.Warning.2);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
